WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Cheap-Drive: Move cars, Win margins.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:12.800
Prototype. Test. Loop. Repeat. Across four model generations: Alpha (677 runs), Beta (268 runs), Gamma (242 runs), and Delta (496 runs).

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:19.800
Beta: filter requests, price for dealer trust, raise gig fees after pickup opens, and meet the 90% on-time gate.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:25.800
Find what broke: inspect dealer notes, pickup windows, and late delivery outcomes in the live week analysis report.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:33.800
More runs cleared the ranking gate across 1,685 practice runs: from 84.6% ranked in Alpha to 98.6% ranked in Delta.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:40.800
Gamma: more margin, but one week missed the gate at 89.96% on time in the first eight-week holdout.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:47.800
Gamma reads notes and pairs two cars in one driver gig, adding +€2,031 per week vs Beta across 8 new practice weeks.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:54.800
Delta uses freed capacity from wider windows and 90 km pairing with a 42% win target, adding +€1,664 per week vs Early Delta across 19 paired weeks.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:59.800
Cheap-Drive: Win the right work. Deliver it.
